- Measure both IRL objects and virtual assets\n- Team up with other players to collaborate on the same assembly in network \"distributed\" or local \"co-located\" states\n", "short_description": "3D CAD Visualization tool utilizing hand tracking\n- Visualize and interact with hardware models in Mixed Reality!\n- Write, draw and measure anything in full free form 3D\n- Build your own assemblies!\n- Collaborate with other players over network or in a co-located space\nEnjoy the immersive experience!"}]}, "developer_name": "Raghavan Vasudevan, Jason Putnam", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/privacy-policy/?utm_source=www.oculus.com&utm_medium=oculusredirect", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meta", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.heycaddy.net/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "24587605277550254"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574716_321133757360998_1552673142774108001_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S6s2F5dxmYoQ7kNvwHxdqZl&_nc_oc=Adql1F3NDl1i8YTfVaeV9ZFRpMAxTShnb9WHFWSAKHAIBzy--e6T8re0l89YH_FLV80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_Qolg1ZynNwQvuV5s-g-2x1SaqE_HeMpC8FT1IKqlbw&oe=6AF87F6F"}, "is_concept": fal